v 0.1.0
d TestMechs (MVP): Stata translation of Jon Roth & Soonwoo Kwon's TestMechs R package.
d
d Installation:
d   net install testmechs, from("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chengchen2326/stata-testmechs/main") replace
d
d testmechs_test_sharpnull (Cox-Shi sharp null test) and testmechs_lb_fracaffected
d (lower bound on fraction of always-takers affected) support randomized settings
d and non-experimental settings via reg_formula (OLS with controls or 2SLS IV).
d Cluster-robust inference uses analytic influence functions verified against
d R's sandwich::estfun x t(bread) to machine precision.
d
d All numerical work runs in three bundled Stata plugins: dqrdc2 for rank
d computation, GLPK for LP, and OSQP for QP. No Python installation is required.
d
d Precompiled plugins ship for macOS Apple Silicon, macOS Intel, Linux x86_64,
d and Windows x86_64.
d
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.ado
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.sthlp
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.ado
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.sthlp
